<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $55-3/4 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $55-3/4 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADS opened $0-1/2 lower at $55-3/4 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The price corresponds to about 255.31 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
